				\begin{document}$y_{c}(d) = a0 * \mathrm {e}^{-d/D_{c}}$\end{document}yc(d)=a0∗e−d/Dc, where yc is the correlation between neighboring cytosines at distance d in transition context c. The parameters a0 and Dc are fitted by the nls-fit.

